# Question 1: Virtual to Physical Address Translation
# Makefile integration guide for xv6-public

# Add _vatest to UPROGS in xv6 Makefile:
# UPROGS=\
#   _cat\
#   _echo\
#   _forktest\
#   _grep\
#   _init\
#   _kill\
#   _ln\
#   _ls\
#   _mkdir\
#   _rm\
#   _sh\
#   _stressfs\
#   _usertests\
#   _wc\
#   _zombie\
#   _vatest\

# Add vatest.c to EXTRA in Makefile:
# EXTRA=\
#   vatest.c\

# Instructions:
# 1. Place vm.c, sysproc.c, syscall.c, syscall.h, defs.h, user.h, usys.S into your xv6 directory.
# 2. Place vatest.c into the xv6 directory.
# 3. make clean
# 4. make qemu-nox
# 5. In the xv6 shell:
#    $ vatest
